<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>go-authn – 비밀</title><link>https://go-authn.github.io/docs/0.11/ko/tags/%EB%B9%84%EB%B0%80/</link><description>Recent content in 비밀 on go-authn</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>ko</language><atom:link href="https://go-authn.github.io/docs/0.11/ko/tags/%EB%B9%84%EB%B0%80/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>secretsource — 참조에서 비밀 가져오기</title><link>https://go-authn.github.io/docs/0.11/ko/libraries/secretsource/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://go-authn.github.io/docs/0.11/ko/libraries/secretsource/</guid><description>
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;파일에 남겨 두면 안 되는 PIN은 어디에서 가져오는가?&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;참조&lt;/strong&gt;는 비밀이 있는
곳을 가리키고, &lt;code&gt;secretsource.Open&lt;/code&gt;이 그것을 가져옵니다. 참조에는 비밀이 들어
있지 않으므로 플래그, 스크립트, 셸 기록에 있어도 됩니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;go get github.com/go-authn/secretsource@v0.9.0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
